title: The Iron Man Armory — Persistent Transferable Agent Identities
summary: 'Proposed .agent files as persistent identity definitions with expertise graphs, cross-project transferability, and confidence-driven behavioral adaptation. Agents specialize through practice (not configuration), transfer patterns across projects, and level up their skills via the graduation framework. Symphony becomes the reputation and collaboration layer. Key insight: agent identity is a new VIEW over existing Paradigm data (lore, confidence, protocols, aspects), not a new system.'
